{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1764008,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Innovation Challenge ","festival_id":null,"organization_id":1022,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-15T00:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/innovation-challenge-panimalar-engineering-college-pec-chennai-1764008","region":"online","details":"<p>MAXIM CODE presents the National Web Development Challenge 2026, a national-level competition designed for students, developers, and innovators to showcase their web development skills through innovative and impactful website projects.<\/p>\n<p>Participation is completely FREE.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to all students, graduates, and developers.<\/li>\n<li>Participants can register individually or as a team.<\/li>\n<li>Inter-college teams are allowed.<\/li>\n<li>Cross-specialization teams are allowed.<\/li>\n<li>Team size: 1 to 4 members.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>For intenship opportunity ( register in this )<\/p>\n<p>https:\/\/forms.gle\/aNZocnJ9AzZeaFwt5<\/p>\n<p><strong>Competition Format:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The competition consists of two stages:<\/p>\n<p>Stage 1: Project Submission Round<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants must submit:<\/li>\n<li>Project PPT Presentation<\/li>\n<li>Website Source Code (ZIP File)<\/li>\n<li>Project Documentation (PDF)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Team Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Stage 2: Evaluation Round<\/p>\n<p>Submitted projects will be reviewed by the evaluation panel based on innovation, functionality, design, and implementation.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Process:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Step 1: Register on Unstop.<\/li>\n<li>Step 2: Develop a Website Based on Any Real-World Problem or Innovative Idea.<\/li>\n<li>Step 3: Prepare the Required Documents and Source Code.<\/li>\n<li>Step 4: Upload the Ppt, Zip File, and Pdf Documentation Before the Deadline.<\/li>\n<li>Step 5: Wait for Evaluation and Result Announcement.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Project Categories:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Educational Platforms<\/li>\n<li>E-Commerce Websites<\/li>\n<li>Portfolio Websites<\/li>\n<li>Business Websites<\/li>\n<li>Healthcare Solutions<\/li>\n<li>Ai-Based Websites<\/li>\n<li>Social Impact Platforms<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Startup Solutions:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Submission Format<\/li>\n<li>Mandatory Files:<\/li>\n<li>Ppt Presentation (.Ppt\/.Pptx\/.Pdf)<\/li>\n<li>Source Code (.Zip)<\/li>\n<li>Project Documentation (.Pdf)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Evaluation Criteria:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Innovation &amp; Creativity<\/li>\n<li>User Interface Design<\/li>\n<li>User Experience<\/li>\n<li>Functionality<\/li>\n<li>Technical Implementation<\/li>\n<li>Project Presentation<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Prizes:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Winner:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Affiliate Internship Opportunity at Maxim Code<\/li>\n<li>Certificate of Excellence<\/li>\n<li>Social Media Recognition<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Runner-Up:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Affiliate Internship Opportunity<\/li>\n<li>Certificate of Achievement<\/li>\n<li>Top 10 Participants<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Merit Certificate:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>All Participants<\/li>\n<li>Participation Certificate<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participation Is Free of Cost.<\/li>\n<li>Projects Must Be Original.<\/li>\n<li>Plagiarism Will Result in Immediate Disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>Teams Must Not Exceed 4 Members.<\/li>\n<li>Multiple Submissions of The Same Project Are Not Allowed.<\/li>\n<li>Participants Must Submit All Required Files Before the Deadline.<\/li>\n<li>Organizers Reserve the Right to Modify Schedules if Required.<\/li>\n<li>The Decision of The Organizers Will Be Final and Binding..&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":29153884,"moderation_stat